{
  "judge": "The Barak model",
  "verdict": "not_justified",
  "protocol_steps": [
    {
      "step": "1. Proper purpose",
      "finding": "Defending civilians and the realm is a proper purpose, given the destruction of surrendered King's Landing in F1 and the announced continuation of the campaign in F2."
